You call upon the immediate help of your Halves.

Your Stone Half will trade places (if in sight) with you and all creatures currently targetting you in a radius of [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] will target it instead.

Your Crystaline Half will instantly fire a volley of level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] earthen missiles at all foes near the stone half (or you if the stone half is dead) in radius [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)].

In addition, as passive effect, your halves now also learn your level of Combat Accuracy.
